					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "EXAMPLE 1: COLOR TO TEXTURE\n\nIn this example we are using the Color node together with the Texture from Data node to create a texture that is half the width of the screen.\nNext we use Resize to resize it to the patch resolution."
